Package: kwrite
Version: @DEB_KWRITE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apps.kde.org/kwrite/
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-crash, kf6-guiaddons, kf6-i18n, kf6-iconthemes, kf6-texteditor, kf6-textwidgets, kf6-widgetsaddons, kf6-windowsystem, libgtkintl
Description: KWrite text editor (Qt6/KF6)
 KDE's focused text editor, built from the Kate source tree. This first Xios
 package builds KWrite and its shared kateprivate runtime without Kate addons
 or text-to-speech support.
